    "description": "The Telecom SIM Portability API facilitates the process of transferring mobile numbers from one telecom service provider to another. This endpoint allows users to initiate portability requests, ensuring a seamless transition of services. It is primarily aimed at telecom service providers and mobile network operators looking to enhance customer experience by simplifying the SIM portability process. By using this API, organizations can efficiently manage customer requests and maintain regulatory compliance while improving customer retention.",
